WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.000
[Leaves rustle softly]

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
[Quiet nibbling]

00:12.500 --> 00:14.500
[A seed drops and rolls]

00:15.300 --> 00:18.000
[Paws scratch on earth]

00:25.500 --> 00:28.500
[Small footsteps]

00:39.000 --> 00:41.500
[Nibbling resumes]

00:42.000 --> 00:44.500
[Cloth folds in the distance]
